<h2 style="color: #b00020;">Your automatic payment didn't go through</h2>

<p>Dear <%= @family.name %>,</p>

<p>We tried to collect <%= @child.first_name %>'s tuition installment for <%= @program.name %> automatically<%= " from your #{@plan.autopay_method_label}" if @plan&.autopay_method_label %>, but the payment didn't go through, including a second try a few days later.</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Amount:</strong> <%= number_to_currency(@payment.amount) %></li>
  <li><strong>Due Date:</strong> <%= @payment.payment_date.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %></li>
  <li><strong>Type:</strong> Tuition Payment<%= " - Installment ##{@payment.installment_number}" if @payment.installment_number %></li>
</ul>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <a href="<%= @pay_url %>" style="background-color: #2e7d32; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block;">
    Pay <%= number_to_currency(@payment.amount) %> Securely
  </a>
</p>
<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #666;">If the button doesn't work, paste this link into your browser:<br><%= @pay_url %></p>

<p>Common reasons are an expired card, a new card number, or a bank that needs you to re-approve the payment. To keep future payments automatic, update your payment method on the Payments page of the family portal.</p>

<p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p>

<p>Warmly,<br>The Earthkin Team</p>
